category: Science
requires: libptscotch7.0 libscotch7.0 libbz2-devel libevent-devel libhwloc-devel liblzma-devel libopenmpi-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Graph partitioning and sparse matrix ordering library (development)"
ldesc: "Scotch is a software package for graph and mesh/hypergraph
partitioning, graph clustering, static mapping and sparse matrix ordering.
PT-Scotch is its parallel, MPI-based version, and libptscotchparmetis provides
a ParMETIS-compatible interface on top of it."
external-source: scotch

